# Rocketeer Boostbuggy: "Whenever this Vehicle attacks, create a Treasure token" and Crew 1 (CR 702.122a). Bot1's only creature,
# Ornithopter (power 0), cannot crew it; once Llanowar Elves (power 1) is cast it can. The crewed 3/2 attacks: Bot1 gets the
# Treasure (one more permanent, untapped) and Bot2 takes 3. Nothing is created before the attack, and nothing when only
# Ornithopter attacks on turn 5 with the Vehicle uncrewed: it is this Vehicle's attack, not any attack.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Forest
Rocketeer Boostbuggy
Llanowar Elves
Ornithopter
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
